7.2 Zero Refinement Protocol

Given an initial guess \gamma_0 for a non-trivial zero \rho = 1/2 + i\gamma:

Function refine_zero(gamma0, tol=1e-30, dps=80):
   Set mpmath precision to dps
   s = 0.5 + i * gamma0
   For iteration = 1 to 50:
      z = zeta(s)
      dz = zeta_prime(s)
      If abs(dz) == 0: break
      delta = z / dz
      s = s - delta
      If abs(z) < tol and abs(delta) < tol:
         Return Im(s)
